{"title":"1987 AJHSME Problems/Problem 3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/c/6/5c69f936debc7ab64c27ab3187b888238c52ad48.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2(81+83+85+87+89+91+93+95+97+99)=$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"423\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/0/8/0083f79020dd10542196a347c83a4d4929ff1007.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\ 1600 \\qquad \\text{(B)}\\ 1650 \\qquad \\text{(C)}\\ 1700 \\qquad \\text{(D)}\\ 1750 \\qquad \\text{(E)}\\ 1800$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"466\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Rearranging terms yields <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/4/7/04717cdd75ad28ab89abedccd3fef14a3566110e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2(81 + 83 + 85 + 87 + 89 + 91 + 93 + 95 + 97 + 99)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"407\" height=\"20\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/7/ce7b1a58eac3ebf6549dfcd479363db98c6d065d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$= 2((81 + 99) + (83 + 97) + (85 + 95) + (87 + 93) + (89 + 91))$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"497\" height=\"20\" /> \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5d6b9f5255a44d5ef2f441198b7c3a6056b55e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$= 2 (180 + 180 + 180 + 180 + 180)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"270\" height=\"20\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/7/8c7ef203a2165ef1319b1f5aaeb371a0b6738085.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$= 2 \\cdot 5 \\cdot 180$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"93\" height=\"14\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/2/26296f33b3674d0d094bca23674b845766d8d977.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$= \\boxed{\\textbf{(E)}\\ 1800}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"102\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Recall that the sum of an arithmetic series <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/3/e/03e968a9d774ac4c9b91e606fcf52d7d5ee05c4d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_1 + ... + a_n = \\frac{n}{2}(a_1 + a_n)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"208\" height=\"34\" />, so this sum is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/e/b/aeb314853d8b4a3cdeec7ef147921789cf637ef4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2\\left(\\frac{10}{2}(81 + 99)\\right) = \\boxed{\\textbf{(E)}\\ 1800}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"240\" height=\"45\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME\" title=\"1987 AJHSME\">1987 AJHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Problems\" title=\"1987 AJHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1987 AJHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=1987\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1987 AJHSME Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1987 AJHSME Problems/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1987 AJHSME Problems/Pr